Domain StudentAttendance
    documentation 'The Student Attendance domain represents both daily and class
                  'period (section) attendance. This model supports two
                  'approaches for collecting attendance data:
                  '
                  '* One attendance event for each student-section (or each
                  'student-day), reporting both attendance and absences
                  '
                  '* "Exception only" reporting, providing attendance events
                  'only for absences and tardies
    domain item AttendanceEvent
    domain item Program
    domain item School
    domain item Section
    domain item SectionAttendanceTakenEvent
    domain item Session
    domain item Staff
    domain item Student
    domain item StudentProgramAssociation
    domain item StudentSectionAssociation

